udy examining the prevalence of diabetes mellitus and impaired glucose regulation in Spain, providing insights into nutritional management for affected patients.", "ESPEN GUIDELINES ON NUTRITION IN CANCER PATIENTS:Guidelines established by the European Society for Clinical Nutrition and Metabolism (ESPEN) regarding nutritional support for cancer patients.", "ARGENINE-SUPPLEMENTED NUTRITION IN MALNOURISHED PATIENTS:A clinical study investigating the effects of arginine-supplemented nutrition on long-term survival in malnourished patients with head and neck cancer.", "SYSTEMATIC REVIEW OF IMMUNONUTRITION:A systematic review analyzing the role of immunonutrition in patients undergoing surgery for head and neck cancer.", "NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT IN CANCER:A comprehensive overview of the role of parenteral and enteral/oral nutritional support in patients with cancer.", "NUTRITIONAL MANAGEMENT IN DIABETIC PATIENTS:A systematic review focusing on enteral nutrition support and the use of diabetes-specific formulas for patients with diabetes.)<|COMPLETE|>", "HOSPITAL CLÍNICO \"LOZANO BLESA\":Hospital Clínico \"Lozano Blesa\" is a medical facility in Zaragoza where Dr. Fernando L. Calvo Gracia works, specializing in endocrinology and nutrition.", "TUMOR PANCREÁTICO:Pancreatic tumor refers to a type of cancer that affects the pancreas, often leading to complications such as hyperglycemia and malnutrition.", "HÍGADO:Hígado (Liver) is a vital organ where lesions were detected during the patient's imaging studies, suggesting potential metastasis. This organ is susceptible to various diseases, including cancer, and plays a crucial role in metabolic processes, such as the regulation of blood sugar levels. During an urgent ultrasound examination, four nodules were identified in the liver, further indicating the need for medical evaluation and potential intervention.", "TROMBOSIS PORTAL:Trombosis portal es una complicación que puede presentarse en pacientes con enfermedades hepáticas. Esta condición se caracteriza por la formación de un coágulo en la vena porta, lo que puede dar lugar a complicaciones adicionales, como la encefalopatía hepática. La trombosis portal está estrechamente relacionada con el estado de salud hepático del paciente, lo que resalta la importancia de un manejo adecuado de las enfermedades del hígado para prevenir esta complicación.", "ENCEFALOPATÍA HEPÁTICA:Hepatic encephalopathy is a decline in brain function that occurs as a result of severe liver disease, often requiring nutritional support and management.", "URGENTES:Urgent care visit for bilateral lumbar pain with ureteral irradiation and urinary symptoms without fever on 17/5/97", "PÁNCREAS:The pancreas is an organ where a 3 cm nodule was discovered during an urgent ultrasound examination."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}